.build-check-doors/

# Signing keys, never in the tree. The record-signing keypair for the
# AGNTCY Directory (registry/agntcy/README.md) is generated OUTSIDE this
# repo on purpose — but a stray copy pasted in here would be committed
# by anyone running `git add -A`, and a private key in git history does
# not come back out. `cosign.pub` is public and harmless; it is ignored
# too, because the published copy is derived into the JWKS from a
# checked-in source rather than read from a loose file.
cosign.key
cosign.pub
*.pem
